{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656004",
      "title": "Planning the App",
      "lectureOrder": 369,
      "videoOrder": 341,
      "sourceHash": "ac4d5721f3cf8a3c60a771b926c419c7fc953c85fd341201e132be2484d2e8fc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 5.869,
          "en": "-: The first step in creating an Angular application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.869,
          "end": 9.69,
          "en": "of course, is to lay out the structure of this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.69,
          "end": 12.51,
          "en": "And especially plan which components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.51,
          "end": 14.46,
          "en": "you are probably going to need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.46,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "Now it's normal that once building the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 19.23,
          "en": "you decide to add another component which you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.23,
          "end": 21.39,
          "en": "didn't plan to add at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.39,
          "end": 23.73,
          "en": "Or maybe you decide that you can merge two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.73,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "components, you thought you would have to split.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "But generally this is still a good approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 32.37,
          "en": "And this should also show you how I approach this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.37,
          "end": 36.21,
          "en": "and how you may decide what should go into its own component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 39.27,
          "en": "and what can be merged into another one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.27,
          "end": 42.12,
          "en": "So on this page I try to lay out the general structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.12,
          "end": 45.54,
          "en": "of our app, and at the bottom you can find kind of a legend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.54,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "So let's start with the features of this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 49.83,
          "en": "Well, we're going to have a shopping list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.83,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "and a recipe book section as I said.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 55.26,
          "en": "Managing either our single ingredients we need to buy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.26,
          "end": 58.234,
          "en": "or in the recipe book to our whole recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.234,
          "end": 61.41,
          "en": "Which components will we need for this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.41,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "Obviously a root component, holding our overall application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 66.54,
          "en": "the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 69.27,
          "en": "Every Angular app has this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.27,
          "end": 71.37,
          "en": "Then since we have two sections,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.37,
          "end": 73.59,
          "en": "it probably makes sense to have some kind of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.59,
          "end": 75.81,
          "en": "header component where we can navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.81,
          "end": 77.49,
          "en": "between these two sections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.49,
          "end": 79.95,
          "en": "Of course, you could also hard code the header simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.95,
          "end": 81.84,
          "en": "into the app component, but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.84,
          "end": 84.9,
          "en": "since it will contain its own business logic, in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.9,
          "end": 87.18,
          "en": "it will trigger a routing action later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.18,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "And it will also add a dropdown there in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.82,
          "end": 92.16,
          "en": "which allows us to store our recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.16,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "on the server and fetch them from there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 97.11699999999999,
          "en": "So since we will have that logic attached to the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.11699999999999,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "outsourcing it into its own component makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.11,
          "end": 101.906,
          "en": "so that we don't have to put all the logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 101.906,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "into our root component, which really mainly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "should only be responsible for holding our overall app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "So that is the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 113.52000000000001,
          "en": "Now let's dive into the individual features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 115.77000000000001,
          "en": "Let's start with the shopping list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.77000000000001,
          "end": 118.08,
          "en": "I guess it makes sense to have the overall shopping",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.08,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 121.68,
          "en": "Remember the purple boxes only the feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 124.111,
          "en": "So we need a component holding our shopping list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 124.111,
          "end": 127.65,
          "en": "And maybe in this shopping list component, we also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 127.65,
          "end": 130.53,
          "en": "want to have a shopping list edit part, which allows us to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "add new items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 134.91,
          "en": "So a input field and a button, because that again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.91,
          "end": 136.35,
          "en": "has its own logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.35,
          "end": 139.29,
          "en": "We will have to decide if we're editing an existing item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 139.29,
          "end": 140.61,
          "en": "or adding a new one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.61,
          "end": 143.16,
          "en": "We need to submit this so it makes sense to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 145.17000000000002,
          "en": "create its own component for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 145.17000000000002,
          "end": 147.9,
          "en": "So as we have our overall list component, mainly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 147.9,
          "end": 150.78,
          "en": "holding the data off the list and the added component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 150.78,
          "end": 153.45,
          "en": "being responsible for managing this data, kind of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 153.45,
          "end": 155.49,
          "en": "though the added component will be nested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 155.49,
          "end": 156.993,
          "en": "inside the list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 157.82999999999998,
          "end": 159.54,
          "en": "I guess that's it for the shopping list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 161.82,
          "en": "Let's have a look at the recipe book.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "Here, it certainly makes sense to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 166.133,
          "en": "again, just like with the shopping list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 166.133,
          "end": 169.23,
          "en": "a recipe list component, which shows us a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.23,
          "end": 170.64,
          "en": "of all our recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 170.64,
          "end": 174.48,
          "en": "Here we might later also put each individual recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 174.48,
          "end": 175.96800000000002,
          "en": "into its own item, though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 175.96800000000002,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "since it holds a little bit more information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 182.057,
          "en": "than just one line of HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 182.057,
          "end": 184.98,
          "en": "and a recipe detail area would be great too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 184.98,
          "end": 188.37,
          "en": "So a area where once we select a recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "we can see informations about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 194.31,
          "en": "Later in the course, we will also add another component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 194.31,
          "end": 196.82999999999998,
          "en": "because we will then somehow need a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 196.82999999999998,
          "end": 200.25,
          "en": "which allows us to add existing recipes or add new ones.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 200.25,
          "end": 202.02,
          "en": "But since this is really advanced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 202.02,
          "end": 203.55,
          "en": "and we would not be able to fill it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 203.55,
          "end": 206.04,
          "en": "with much life right now, I will omit it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 206.04,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "for now and focus on the displaying part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 211.109,
          "en": "So a list with items and then the details section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 211.109,
          "end": 214.56,
          "en": "which displays the details for the currently selected item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 214.56,
          "end": 217.29,
          "en": "I guess this looks like a good plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 217.29,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "Each of these components should hold a significant amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 222.437,
          "en": "of business logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 222.437,
          "end": 225.688,
          "en": "and I guess with the component sketch out here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 225.688,
          "end": 228.87,
          "en": "We're really having each component focus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 228.87,
          "end": 233.16,
          "en": "on one main topic, displaying a list, displaying information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 233.16,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "about a single item, displaying detail information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 238.62,
          "en": "about a selected item, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 238.62,
          "end": 241.47,
          "en": "So those generally how I approach this, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 241.47,
          "end": 243.93,
          "en": "feel free to split this up even more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 243.93,
          "end": 246.78,
          "en": "or if you want merge them together, for example:",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 246.78,
          "end": 248.43,
          "en": "recipe list and a single item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 248.43,
          "end": 249.63,
          "en": "But this will become more clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 249.63,
          "end": 252.81,
          "en": "once we actually implement these components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 252.81,
          "end": 255.15,
          "en": "Now, one last thing we should think about,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 255.15,
          "end": 257.4,
          "en": "which models will we use in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 257.4,
          "end": 260.79,
          "en": "And with model I simply mean which data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 260.79,
          "end": 263.97,
          "en": "So we certainly will need some representation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 263.97,
          "end": 265.71,
          "en": "for our ingredient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 265.71,
          "end": 269.07,
          "en": "We will use ingredients a lot in the recipe book too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 269.07,
          "end": 271.59,
          "en": "Each recipe there has a couple of ingredients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 271.59,
          "end": 275.25,
          "en": "So we should define how an ingredient looks like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 275.25,
          "end": 278.46,
          "en": "That is something which your application probably",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 278.46,
          "end": 279.48,
          "en": "also needs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 279.48,
          "end": 281.76,
          "en": "Be clear about the data you're going to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 281.76,
          "end": 283.579,
          "en": "and put it into its own class so,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 283.579,
          "end": 286.779,
          "en": "that you have your own type you can use later on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 286.779,
          "end": 289.40999999999997,
          "en": "and that you have a clear interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 289.40999999999997,
          "end": 292.35,
          "en": "or definition of what your data looks like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 292.35,
          "end": 294.84000000000003,
          "en": "so that you can easily have your components talk",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 294.84000000000003,
          "end": 295.77,
          "en": "with each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 295.77,
          "end": 298.32,
          "en": "Something will dive in later in this course so that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 298.32,
          "end": 301.53,
          "en": "there is no issue regarding the data you were exchanging.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 301.53,
          "end": 303.48,
          "en": "So besides the ingredients,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 303.48,
          "end": 305.37,
          "en": "which probably is a very simple model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 305.37,
          "end": 308.73,
          "en": "only controlling the name and amount, maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 308.73,
          "end": 310.41,
          "en": "We also will need a model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 310.41,
          "end": 312.33,
          "en": "for the recipe which contains things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 312.33,
          "end": 317.33,
          "en": "like the title, the description, the ingredients, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 317.4,
          "end": 320.1,
          "en": "And I think with this we have a solid plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 320.1,
          "end": 322.26,
          "en": "For now, let's get started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 322.26,
          "end": 324.81,
          "en": "Let's implement all these components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 324.81,
          "end": 328.02,
          "en": "fill it with some dummy data for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 328.02,
          "end": 331.83299999999997,
          "en": "and take the first step in building our course project.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
